    "name": "Dead In Your TrackZ",
    "steam_appid": 3682760,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/Pistol_GIf.gif?t=1754280015\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead In Your TrackZ</strong> is a VR Zombie Shooter created by 3 brothers! Defend your train from hordes of zombies until your train has refueled. It features <strong>multiple zombie types</strong>, <strong>weapon and train upgrades</strong>, and different <strong>levels and environments</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/65af189535e2c90b7845cf1dabed5f4b.poster.avif?t=1754280015\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/65af189535e2c90b7845cf1dabed5f4b.webm?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/65af189535e2c90b7845cf1dabed5f4b.mp4?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with accessibility and comfort in mind, in\u00a0<strong>Dead In Your TrackZ</strong>, the train remains stationary while you fuel up and fight against the zombies. Once your train is fully fueled up, pull the horn and defend against the final horde before your train boosts out of there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a variety of <strong>weapons, upgrades,</strong> and <strong>environments</strong>. Tired of the basic <strong>pistol</strong>? Use the <strong>double barrel shotgun</strong> instead to kill multiple zombies in one shot. Or, upgrade your pistol with a <strong>laser sight, compensator</strong>, and <strong>extended mags</strong> to make zombie killing easier. If you're tired of manually shooting zombies, the train can be upgraded with an <strong>auto-turret!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/87397dfb17e3411afed9e95fa8f8d5a0.poster.avif?t=1754280015\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/87397dfb17e3411afed9e95fa8f8d5a0.webm?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/87397dfb17e3411afed9e95fa8f8d5a0.mp4?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing levels and killing zombies will earn you score. You can use this score to purchase a variety of <strong>upgrades</strong> for your <strong>train and your weapons</strong>\u00a0which will give you a range of advantages and benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/20f4bac89f90e67566d1d443a9f5649c.poster.avif?t=1754280015\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/20f4bac89f90e67566d1d443a9f5649c.webm?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/20f4bac89f90e67566d1d443a9f5649c.mp4?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/Pistol_GIf.gif?t=1754280015\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead In Your TrackZ</strong> is a VR Zombie Shooter created by 3 brothers! Defend your train from hordes of zombies until your train has refueled. It features <strong>multiple zombie types</strong>, <strong>weapon and train upgrades</strong>, and different <strong>levels and environments</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/65af189535e2c90b7845cf1dabed5f4b.poster.avif?t=1754280015\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/65af189535e2c90b7845cf1dabed5f4b.webm?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/65af189535e2c90b7845cf1dabed5f4b.mp4?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with accessibility and comfort in mind, in\u00a0<strong>Dead In Your TrackZ</strong>, the train remains stationary while you fuel up and fight against the zombies. Once your train is fully fueled up, pull the horn and defend against the final horde before your train boosts out of there!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game contains a variety of <strong>weapons, upgrades,</strong> and <strong>environments</strong>. Tired of the basic <strong>pistol</strong>? Use the <strong>double barrel shotgun</strong> instead to kill multiple zombies in one shot. Or, upgrade your pistol with a <strong>laser sight, compensator</strong>, and <strong>extended mags</strong> to make zombie killing easier. If you're tired of manually shooting zombies, the train can be upgraded with an <strong>auto-turret!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/87397dfb17e3411afed9e95fa8f8d5a0.poster.avif?t=1754280015\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/87397dfb17e3411afed9e95fa8f8d5a0.webm?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/87397dfb17e3411afed9e95fa8f8d5a0.mp4?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Completing levels and killing zombies will earn you score. You can use this score to purchase a variety of <strong>upgrades</strong> for your <strong>train and your weapons</strong>\u00a0which will give you a range of advantages and benefits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/20f4bac89f90e67566d1d443a9f5649c.poster.avif?t=1754280015\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/20f4bac89f90e67566d1d443a9f5649c.webm?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3682760/extras/20f4bac89f90e67566d1d443a9f5649c.mp4?t=1754280015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
